Chapter: BvtSkill1998
  cites Uoaix chapter SkillCurve
  cites Uoaix chapter BvtCheck

 SmithModel's pinned case (Uoaix1998Skills.md, codex_run 2026-10-12): Blacksmithy 92.4, strength 100, base delay 1000,
 the executioner's axe at difficulty 918: chance 526 and 668 tenths per 10,000 swings; the advance rate 1999 at 50.0
 and 99 at 100.0.
  bs98-zero : Integer, Integer, Integer -> Integer
  bs98-zero (buf) (at) (stop) = if at >= stop then buf else let a = poke-qword buf at 0 in bs98-zero buf (at + 8) stop
  bs98-row : Integer, Integer -> Integer
  bs98-row (skill) (level) = let cells = bs98-zero (alloc-bytes 368) 0 368 in let a = poke-qword cells (skill * 8) level in cells
  bvt-skill-1998 : Integer -> [Console] Integer
  bvt-skill-1998 (unused) = act
    a <- bvt-check "UOAIX-242: Blacksmithy's advance rate is SmithModel's, 1999 at 50.0 and 99 at 100.0" (s98-delay 7 500 == 1999 & s98-delay 7 1000 == 99)
    value <- s98-value 7 924 100 0 0
    chance <- s98-chance value 918 50
    b <- bvt-check "UOAIX-242: the executioner's axe at 92.4 and strength 100 is chance 526 and 668 tenths per 10,000 swings" (value == 931 & chance == 526 & chance * s98-gain 7 924 chance 100 / 100 == 668)
    low <- bs98-row 7 300
    failed <- skc-learn low 0 7 0 False 0
    c <- bvt-check "UOAIX-242 D3: below 50.0 a failed check gains" (failed >= 3 & peek-qword low 56 == 300 + failed)
    high <- bs98-row 7 600
    missed <- skc-learn high 0 7 0 False 0
    d <- bvt-check "UOAIX-242 D3: from 50.0 a failed check gains nothing" (missed == 0 & peek-qword high 56 == 600)
    made <- skc-learn high 0 7 0 True 0
    e <- bvt-check "UOAIX-242: from 50.0 a success gains" (made >= 1 & peek-qword high 56 == 600 + made)
    sure <- bs98-row 7 600
    certain <- skc-learn sure 0 7 1000 True 0
    f <- bvt-check "UOAIX-242: a check that cannot fail gains nothing" (certain == 0 & peek-qword sure 56 == 600)
    g <- bvt-check "UOAIX-242: a gain's fraction of a tenth is won by the roll" (s98-tenths 1500 499 == 2 & s98-tenths 1500 500 == 1)
    a + b + c + d + e + f + g
  end
